  "details": "I think it would be great if we hand the ability to change the hand tracking bindings.\n\nWhy? To help people with less real life hand function to enjoy hand tracking as well.\n\nI'm missing a few fingers on my left hand making it impossible to move around in game. All I can do is to open the menu, if I'm lucky. And if we could unbind things we don't need I would get rid of the accidental inputs from headsets trying to make sense of my hand.\n\nSo the ability to move movement over to the right hand would make it possible for me to move around a bit at least without reaching for the controllers all the time.\n\nI'm probably quite a minority with this problem. But I'm sure there are more people with lesser hand function and stuff that would benefit from this. And other people just like to customize how they use it.",
